   "key": "s2.other",
   "record": "1015c0c4a3e41068e5268c3ec2a8e9b41db3c052dd41ed2460956bc9e4ed72fa",
   "status": "DISAGREE",
   "ruling": "Ruling: model error; as the earlier rulings of this line: s2.other is the project's screen ('Any amount on Schedule 2 other than the following?', the lines this tool figures), which the IRS pages do not define, as the reply says; its reading 'line 21 above zero' would refuse or flag every return with self-employment tax, Additional Medicare Tax or net investment income tax, which the tool computes. The line changed only through s2.lookback_ask's royalty leg, now read through s2.lookback_royalty (a choice on scope.rental) with the same value for every known answer (BUG-1448). Project stands.",
   "subject_key": "dbc2d8c6314620c43a453ebf4020c251c10bfb9a44f6ce9fc464bf492788a133"
  },
